<div class="practice-page">
  <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to exercises</a>
  <h1 class="practice-title">Login Page</h1>
  <div class="practice-banner"><ul>
    <li>Login with valid credentials (<strong>test</strong> / <strong>test123</strong>) and verify the success message</li>
    <li>Submit invalid credentials and assert the error message appears</li>
    <li>Leave fields empty and verify validation prevents login</li>
    <li>After login, verify you are redirected to the secure area</li>
  </ul></div>

  <div style="max-width:420px;">
    <p style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.85rem; margin-bottom:0.2rem;">Username: <strong>test</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Password: <strong>test123</strong></p>
    <form name="login" id="login" action="/authenticate" method="post" style="margin-top:1rem;">
      <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom:0.8rem;">
        <label for="username" style="font-weight:600; display:block; margin-bottom:0.3rem;">Username</label>
        <input type="text" class="form-control" name="username" id="username" style="width:100%; padding:0.5rem; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius:6px;" />
      </div>
      <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
        <label for="password" style="font-weight:600; display:block; margin-bottom:0.3rem;">Password</label>
        <input type="password" class="form-control" name="password" id="password" style="width:100%; padding:0.5rem; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius:6px;" />
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" style="width:100%; padding:0.6rem;">
        <i class="fa fa-sign-in" aria-hidden="true"></i> Login
      </button>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>
